# IDE / Editor files
# .idea folders are ignored, except in the project root and there only the module file,
# the project libraries and the module list. Those files point out the database driver,
# so that the Run button in IntelliJ keeps working after a pull.
# workspace.xml is left out: it changes constantly and holds machine-local paths.
.idea/
!/.idea/
/.idea/*
!/.idea/libraries/
!/.idea/modules.xml
*.iml
!Projektarbete.iml
.vscode/
.agents/
.project
.classpath
run.sh
.mise.toml
.mise.*.toml

# Build output
out/
bin/
target/
*.class
# The file list start.sh generates for javac; created and deleted on every run
sources.txt

# Local database, created by the app and not to be version controlled.
# The leading slash anchors the rule to the repository root; otherwise it would
# also match the source folder com/wac/autocore/data/ and new files there would vanish.
# Without a trailing slash the rule also matches a link, not just a folder: the database
# lives on the NVMe and data is a link to it.
/data
*.db

# Archives & Temporary files
*.zip
*.pdf
RetrospektDagbok.md

# Personal test reports and local results
rapport.md
rapport*.md
ARKITEKTUR_OCH_DESIGNMONSTER.md

# OS files
*.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# JVM crash logs
hs_err_pid*.log

